{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>ויתן</b> — the Gaon [Saadia] said: the meaning is that [HaShem] gave him favor and kindness and compassion in the eyes of the chief officer, and he did not fulfill his request, and he [Daniel] answered that he did not reveal his secret to the king, for he would not let him live."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "Resolved הגאון as Saadia per standard convention. The antecedents of the pronouns in the latter clause are ambiguous in the Hebrew; translated hyper-literally without disambiguation."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:47.571109818Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}